│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Applies the recommended depth-compression trick to the entangling ZZ ring: instead of     │
│                          │ chaining all nearest-neighbor ZZ gates sequentially (which forces full serial depth       │
│                          │ because each consecutive pair shares a qubit), split the ring into two alternating        │
│                          │ sublayers of non-overlapping edges — "even" edges ([0,1],[2,3],[4,5],[6,7]) followed by   │
│                          │ "odd" edges ([1,2],[3,4],[5,6],[7,0]) — all still sharing the single "zz_ring" parameter. │
│                          │ Gates within each sublayer act on disjoint qubit pairs and can be scheduled in parallel,  │
│                          │ cutting the ring's contribution to circuit depth roughly in half (from ~7 sequential      │
│                          │ layers to ~2) while adding the missing wraparound edge (7,0) to complete the ring         │
│                          │ topology at no extra parameter cost. This preserves the exact same parameter count and    │
│                          │ connectivity (now a full ring instead of an open chain), but reduces overall depth, which │
│                          │ should help convergence speed and the train/val gap without hurting the worst-group       │
│                          │ margin, consistent with the reference Gen 28 alternating-sublayer trick.                  │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0566                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 4; deleted: 0; modified: 7;                                                        │
