│ patch_description        │ Add an orthogonal entangling sublayer using nearest-neighbor XX gates around the ring     │
│                          │ (0-1,1-2,...,7-0), all sharing a single new parameter "xx_ring". This is inserted between │
│                          │ the existing ZZ ring and the backward CNOT ladder. XX (X-basis) coupling is complementary │
│                          │ to the ZZ (Z-basis) coupling already present and to the RY-based state preparation,       │
│                          │ giving the circuit richer entangling structure that can better separate hard-to-classify  │
│                          │ samples (improving worst-group margin) while adding only one extra trainable parameter (5 │
│                          │ distinct params total, still very economical).                                            │
