│ patch_description        │ Add a mid-circuit mini-sandwich block immediately after the forward CNOT ladder: a        │
│                          │ two-group RY layer reusing "ry_a"/"ry_b" (following the same interleaved even/odd wire    │
│                          │ partition already used for the pre-rotation layer) followed by a global RZ on all wires   │
│                          │ with a new shared parameter "rz_mid". This adds expressivity in the mixing region between │
│                          │ the initial encoding rotation and the entangling ring, giving the model an extra          │
│                          │ nonlinear mixing stage that reuses existing parameters where possible (only one new       │
│                          │ trainable name "rz_mid" is introduced), which should help separate the hardest validation │
│                          │ group (worst_group_margin) without significantly increasing parameter count.              │
