│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ add_crz_ring_theta                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ Add a directional CRZ layer on the nearest-neighbor ring (wires [0,1],[1,2],...,[7,0])    │
│                          │ sharing the existing "theta" parameter, inserted right before the final RZ sandwich       │
│                          │ layer. Unlike the symmetric ZZ couplers already present, CRZ is control/target            │
│                          │ asymmetric, so this introduces new directional phase correlations across the same         │
│                          │ connectivity without adding any new trainable parameter name (still n_distinct_params=2). │
│                          │ This is expected to strengthen entangling expressivity and improve worst-group            │
│                          │ margin/separation while keeping parameter economy maximal, mirroring the successful RZ/ZZ │
│                          │ fusion pattern already used in this ansatz.                                               │
